{"page_id": "synth_copies-images_sv664b471b-p1", "markdown": "CAL RESEARCH\n\n• Submission to Parliament of a new PFM law • Improve the Bulk Supply Transaction Account (BSTA) to accurately measure the electricity subsidy • Parliament approval of a full revision of the Banking Act\n\nTax Reforms to be Implemented for 2022-25\n\nJanuary 1, 2024 - • Start estimating and publishing the direct costs imposed by tax incentives granted under the Strategic Development Projects and Board of Investment Acts. • Revamp the VAT system by abolishing the vast majority of exemptions. • Take measures to significantly speed up valid VAT refunds and abolish the SVAT system. • Introduce automatic indexation of excises to inflation\n\nApril 1, 2023 - • Increase the tax rates pertaining to the Betting and Gaming Levy\n\nJanuary 1, 2025 - • Introduce a nationwide real property tax and gift and inheritance tax\n\n2019\n\nAct.\n\n-0.2\n\n2020 Act.\n\n-3.5\n\n2021\n\nAct.\n\n3.3\n\n2022 Prel.\n\n-8.7\n\nReal GDP growth (%) Inflation average (% GDP) Inflation Year end (% GDP)\n\nFiscal Revenue (% GDP) Expenditure (% GDP)\n\n4.3\n\n4.6\n\n6.0\n\n46.4\n\n4.8\n\n4.2\n\n12.1\n\n57.2\n\n11.9 19.5\n\n8.7 20.7\n\n8.3\n\n19.9\n\n8.5 18.9\n\nPrimary Balance (% GDP)\n\n- 1.9\n\n-5.9\n\n-5.7\n\n-3.8\n\nCentral Government GFN (% GDP) Public debt (% GDP) Reserves (USD Mn) IMF Forecasts\n\n21.7\n\n26.1\n\n31.0\n\n34.5\n\n89.0 7,642\n\n104.0 5,664\n\n114.3 3,139\n\n128.1 1,898\n\n2023\n\nProj. -3\n\n28.5\n\n15.2\n\n11.0 19.0\n\n-0.7\n\n26.6\n\n111.2 4,431\n\n2024\n\nProj. 1.5\n\n8.7\n\n6.7\n\n13.3 19.7\n\n0.8\n\n17.9\n\n108.5 6,128\n\n2025\n\nProj. 2.6\n\n5.6\n\n5.6\n\n14.9\n\n19.9\n\n2.3\n\n15.4\n\n107.8 8,250\n\n2026\n\nProj.\n\n3.0\n\n5.2\n\n5.2\n\n15.0 19.9\n\n2.3\n\n15.9\n\n106.8 10,888", "width": 1700, "height": 2200, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "CAL RESEARCH", "bbox": {"x": 1112.0, "y": 124.7, "width": 517.7, "height": 70.3}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• Submission to Parliament of a new PFM l